{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_28","type":"agent_message","text":"Implemented “return home to win” entirely within `game/games/lanterns`.\n\n- Lighting all twelve now activates a saved intermediate state; it no longer wins immediately.\n- The timer continues until the fox returns within 2 horizontal units of spawn.\n- Reaching the deadline during the return still loses.\n- Added an explicit return-home HUD instruction and updated title/victory copy.\n- Save version bumped and intermediate state/timer restoration verified.\n- Inspection command names remain unchanged; adapter events now report win only after returning home.\n- Geometry, movement, and physics are unchanged.\n\nVerification passed:\n\n- `cargo test --manifest-path game/Cargo.toml -p lanterns-logic`\n- `bun game/games/lanterns/proof.mjs linux`\n- Diff hygiene and 1,500-line limits checked."}}
